<body style="height: auto; min-height: auto;">Ref No: {{{Case.Case_Number__c}}}<br />
<br />
Hi {{{Case.First_Name__c}}},
<p>Thank you for getting in touch with the Qantas Customer Care team.<br />
<br />
I’m sorry to hear about your experience at {{{Case.Departure_Airport__c}}} when you missed check-in for your flight {{{Case.Flight_Number__c}}} to {{{Case.Arrival_City__c}}}.<br />
<br />
<strong>We take our flight schedule seriously</strong><br />
<br />
We’re committed to getting our flights out on time for our customers and have a system in place that stops check-in exactly 30 minutes prior to scheduled departure.<br />
<br />
I’m sorry to learn that our staff member didn’t handle the matter as courteously as expected; check-in staff aren't permitted to re-open check-in once it has closed, and changing to a later flight does attract a fee.<br />
<br />
<strong><em>If claims was in line for 5-10 minutes add:</em></strong><br />
<br />
It’s common to encounter a short wait to check-in, so we recommend customers arrive at the airport no later than 45 minutes prior to departure.<br />
<br />
<strong>We value your opinion</strong><br />
<br />
Customer feedback plays an important role in our continuous improvement process so that we can provide you with exceptional service from start to finish.<br />
<br />
I want to assure you that I’ve passed your feedback on to the relevant team for future improvement.<br />
<br />
Thank you for taking the time to contact us — we look forward to welcoming you onboard soon.</p>
</body>
</html>